+        Stock calibration anchors the reference to the zero configuration, so "zero operator
+        displacement" would pull the arms toward whatever IK solution reaches those wrists,
+        not the canonical joints. Anchoring to the canonical pose's wrist poses makes zero
+        displacement == canonical pose, so parking there and releasing is jump-free.
