+    """Set the model's default/initial body pose for the UPPER-BODY joints in `mapping`
+    (unlisted upper-body joints -> 0). Leg/waist entries are ignored (lower-body policy owns them).
+    Values outside the joint limits are clipped (with a warning)."""
